WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.560
This video covers discharge and follow-up.

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:05.910
Start on the Discharge Notes tab and
read what the client will receive.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:09.030
Then choose Send Email,
and Send discharge notes.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.630
Add the client's email.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.190
Next, choose how replies work.

00:00:13.575 --> 00:00:16.055
Every account can send with no-reply: a

00:00:16.055 --> 00:00:18.285
one-way email the client can't answer.

00:00:18.375 --> 00:00:22.205
With noctune Nest, a private
relay address sends it instead.

00:00:22.375 --> 00:00:26.445
The client never sees your own address,
and replies come back to noctune.

00:00:26.455 --> 00:00:28.365
Nothing is sent until you choose Send.

00:00:28.973 --> 00:00:32.563
To follow up later, choose
Send Email, then Send message.

00:00:32.733 --> 00:00:36.643
Choose Templates to insert a saved
email, like a recheck reminder.

00:00:36.813 --> 00:00:38.883
The same route choice appears here.

00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:41.773
With Nest, the reply
address belongs to this

00:00:41.773 --> 00:00:44.483
encounter, so the conversation
stays with the visit.

00:00:44.988 --> 00:00:46.588
You can also send from your personal

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:48.818
email, which shows the
client your address.

00:00:49.573 --> 00:00:54.123
Client replies arrive in Messages,
linked to the patient and the encounter.

00:00:54.213 --> 00:00:56.853
Open the thread, jump to the
encounter if you need the

00:00:56.853 --> 00:00:59.963
note, and choose Reply to
answer in the same conversation.
